+
+- `source/tests/security/web-replay-export.test.ts:8`, `source/tests/unit/web-replay-capture.test.ts:13`, `source/tests/security/web-replay-gateway.test.ts:15`: committed test suites require machine-specific retained `/tmp/mekoniq-*` paths. The current evidence is valid, but these tests are not reproducible on another checkout without an undocumented filesystem reconstruction step. Provide an explicit retained-evidence input/configuration with a digest-verified preparation recipe and a clear missing-input failure, while keeping portable synthetic reader/HTTP tests independently runnable. Do not silently turn missing retained evidence into a pass.
